<title>INDIA: Indian Dec 24-sector industrial output up 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Indian Dec 24-sector industrial output up 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's 24-sector industrial production index rose 4.5 percent in December over the same month in 1995, the Industry Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In April-December 1996, the index increased 4.8 percent compared to the corresponding period in the previous year, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    24-SECTOR INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION	Dec 96    Apr-Dec 96</p>
<p>    Electricity				   +3.8	  +3.5</p>
<p>    Coal					    +3.5	  +6.2</p>
<p>    Saleable steel				+3.6	  +2.9</p>
<p>    Crude petroleum			     -7.1	  -8.8</p>
<p>    Petroleum Refinery Products	     +8.9	  +6.6</p>
<p>    Cement					  +1.1	 +10.1</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    SIX INFRASTRUCTURE INDUSTRIES	   +2.7	  +3.3</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    Steel ingots				  +0.4	  +3.3</p>
<p>    Nitrogenous fertiliser		    +0.3	  -3.1</p>
<p>    Phosphatic fertiliser		    +23.1	  -0.2</p>
<p>    Pig iron (saleable)			+69.3	 +20.6</p>
<p>    Aluminium				     +6.7	  +0.7</p>
<p>    Copper cathodes			    +26.9	  -6.1</p>
<p>    Sugar					   -8.0	 +12.5</p>
<p>    Salt					   -11.5	  +2.4</p>
<p>    Cloth-mill sector			   -5.5	  -4.8</p>
<p>    Cloth-decentralised sector	     +10.5	 +11.9</p>
<p>    Cotton yarn				   +9.3	  +3.8</p>
<p>    Jute manufacture			   +13.7	  -4.3</p>
<p>    Commercial vehicles			+17.0	 +18.4</p>
<p>    Cars					   +16.4	 +19.3</p>
<p>    Jeeps					  +17.5	 +17.6</p>
<p>    Motor cycles				 +26.5	 +23.3</p>
<p>    Auto rickshaws			     +24.6	 +35.6</p>
<p>    Scooter mopeds				+8.8	 +13.8</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    18 MAJOR INDUSTRIES			 +7.2	  +7.5</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    OVERALL					 +4.5	  +4.8</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>NOTE - The index includes 24 sectors accounting for 50.4 percent of the overall index of industrial production. The figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
